## Notes: Mythic+ group search presets built from your own progress. Unofficial companion to Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-ruRU: Пресеты поиска групп M+ из вашего прогресса. Неофициальное дополнение к Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-deDE: Voreinstellungen für die Gruppensuche aus Eurem Mythisch+-Fortschritt. Inoffizielle Ergänzung zu Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-frFR: Préréglages de recherche de groupe M+ basés sur votre progression. Complément non officiel à Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-esES: Preajustes de búsqueda de grupos M+ a partir de tu progreso. Complemento no oficial de Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-esMX: Preajustes de búsqueda de grupos M+ a partir de tu progreso. Complemento no oficial de Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-itIT: Preset per la ricerca gruppi M+ basati sui tuoi progressi. Aggiunta non ufficiale a Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-ptBR: Predefinições de busca de grupos M+ a partir do seu progresso. Complemento não oficial ao Premade Groups Filter.
## Notes-koKR: 내 진행도로 만드는 쐐기돌 파티 찾기 프리셋. Premade Groups Filter의 비공식 보조 애드온.
## Notes-zhCN: 根据你的进度生成的大秘境组队搜索预设。Premade Groups Filter 的非官方辅助插件。
## Notes-zhTW: 根據你的進度產生的大秘境組隊搜尋預設。Premade Groups Filter 的非官方輔助插件。

